4MGUtNDVkOC05OWFjLWM4M2VkN2ZmOTVhMCJ9&source=post_page-----fbb68f3dade6---------------------------------------)#Report powered by Power BI#{1}":[21,24],"##Contents":[25,39],"##Contents#{1}":[27,39],"##What you’re building":[40,55],"##What you’re building#{1}":[42,55],"##Naming used in this guide":[56,66],"##Naming used in this guide#{1}":[58,66],"##The building blocks":[67,74],"##The building blocks#{1}":[69,74],"##Block 1 — Selector (the slicer’s choices)":[75,98],"##Block 1 — Selector (the slicer’s choices)#{1}":[77,98],"##Optional — sorting your real category column, not just the Selector":[99,121],"##Optional — sorting your real category column, not just the Selector#{1}":[101,115],"##Optional — sorting your real category column, not just the Selector#Steps:":[116,121],"##Optional — sorting your real category column, not just the Selector#Steps:#{1}":[118,121],"##Block 2 — Position measures":[122,157],"##Block 2 — Position measures#{1}":[124,157],"##Block 3 — Color by position":[158,172],"##Block 3 — Color by position#{1}":[160,161],"##Block 3 — Color by position#1\\. Select the chart → Format visual → Data colors.":[162,163],"##Block 3 — Color by position#2\\. You’ll see one color swatch per Position measure. Set:":[164,168],"##Block 3 — Color by position#2\\. You’ll see one color swatch per Position measure. Set:#{1}":[166,168],"##Block 3 — Color by position#3\\. Turn the legend off (Format visual → Legend → Show = Off).":[169,172],"##Block 3 — Color by position#3\\. Turn the legend off (Format visual → Legend → Show = Off).#{1}":[171,172],"##Wiring it up in the report":[173,192],"##Wiring it up in the report#{1}":[176,177],"##Wiring it up in the report#Build (or rebind) the chart:":[178,183],"##Wiring it up in the report#Build (or rebind) the chart:#{1}":[180,183],"##Wiring it up in the report#Add the selector slicer:":[184,188],"##Wiring it up in the report#Add the selector slicer:#{1}":[186,188],"##Wiring it up in the report#Colors & legend — see Block 3 above.":[189,192],"##Wiring it up in the report#Colors & legend — see Block 3 above.#{1}":[191,192],"##Optional — a custom tooltip":[193,253],"##Optional — a custom tooltip#{1}":[196,253],"##Quick test checklist":[254,264],"##Quick test checklist#{1}":[256,264],"##Why this method?":[265,281],"##Why this method?#{1}":[267,281]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Power BI Report","target":"https://app.powerbi.com/view?r=eyJrIjoiYmRiN2QzNjYtMDNlNi00NTdmLTg0MmItNjIyNTViODg2NWQ2IiwidCI6ImRmODY3OWNkLWE4MGUtNDVkOC05OWFjLWM4M2VkN2ZmOTVhMCJ9&source=post_page-----fbb68f3dade6---------------------------------------","line":17},{"title":"**Buy Me a Coffee**","target":"https://buymeacoffee.com/powerlib","line":269},{"title":"**Ko-Fi**","target":"https://ko-fi.com/powerlib","line":269},{"title":"**website**","target":"https://powerlib.super.site/","line":269},{"title":"LinkedIn","target":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/iwasanjaya/","line":269},{"title":"email","target":"mailto:hello.powerlib@gmail.com","line":269},{"title":"calculate","target":"calculate","line":271},{"title":"filter-context-vs-row-context","target":"filter-context-vs-row-context","line":274},{"title":"enhancing-data-narratives-power-bi-tooltips","target":"enhancing-data-narratives-power-bi-tooltips","line":277},{"title":"power-query-etl-workflow","target":"power-query-etl-workflow","line":280}],"metadata":{"created":"2026-07-27","source":"How to Highlight a Segment in a 100% Stacked Chart and Move It to the Baseline in Power BI","source_url":"https://medium.com/@iwasanjaya/how-to-highlight-a-segment-in-a-100-stacked-chart-and-move-it-to-the-baseline-in-power-bi-fbb68f3dade6","note_type":"source","tags":["#power-bi"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[79,90],[107,114],[128,133],[137,148],[202,205],[209,218],[224,234],[238,241]],"key":"01.Knowledge/Power BI/Wiki/highlight-segment-100-stacked-chart-power-bi.md"},
